**Problems:** Partition Labels

**Template 5: Circular Array Greedy**

Use when: Finding valid starting point in circular array.

```java
// Java
int total = 0;    // Check if solution exists
int tank = 0;     // Current tank level
int start = 0;    // Candidate starting point

for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
    int net = gas[i] - cost[i];
    total += net;
    tank += net;

    if (tank < 0) {
        start = i + 1;  // Reset: start from next station
        tank = 0;
    }
}

return total >= 0 ? start : -1;
```

