**Template 6: BFS-like Level Tracking**

Use when: Finding minimum jumps/steps to reach a goal.

```java
// Java
if (nums.length <= 1) return 0;  // Already at destination

int jumps = 0;
int currentEnd = 0;   // Farthest index reachable with current jumps
int farthest = 0;     // Farthest index reachable with one more jump

for (int i = 0; i < nums.length - 1; i++) {
    farthest = Math.max(farthest, i + nums[i]);

    if (i == currentEnd) {
        jumps++;
        currentEnd = farthest;

        if (currentEnd >= nums.length - 1) break;
    }
}
return jumps;
```

